I am a professional 3D artist specializing in the creation of high-quality 3D models for a wide range of industries, including jewelry, weapons, food, vehicles, toys, anatomy, props, and concept assets. Each model is carefully designed with attention to detail, clean geometry, and practical usability.
All models are created with professional workflows and are suitable for games, films, animations, visualizations, presentations, and educational projects. Quality, accuracy, and consistency are my top priorities.
This product is a high-quality 3D printable collection of four unique human skull models, each featuring distinct cracks, fractures, and surface variations. The set is designed to provide both anatomical realism and visual diversity, making it suitable for educational, artistic, and display purposes.
Each skull in the collection has been individually refined to ensure that the fracture patterns appear natural and believable, inspired by realistic bone damage rather than exaggerated or stylized effects. While each model shares correct human skull proportions, no two skulls are identical, allowing for varied presentation and storytelling.
The models are fully optimized for 3D printing. All meshes are watertight, manifold, and solid, ensuring reliable results on common FDM and resin 3D printers. Structural thicknesses are carefully adjusted to maintain strength while preserving surface detail, making the skulls suitable for both small and large print sizes.
The models are delivered without textures, providing a clean base that is ideal for painting, weathering, aging effects, or educational labeling. After printing, the skulls can be easily post-processed, sanded, primed, and painted to match the desired style — from museum-grade replicas to dark fantasy or horror displays.
This collection is well suited for:

  - Medical and anatomy education;

  - Museum and exhibition displays;

  - Artistic sculptures and dioramas;

  - Horror, fantasy, and cinematic props;

  - Teaching aids and tactile learning;

  - Collectors and 3D printing enthusiasts;

Each skull can be printed and used individually or combined as a complete set to create cohesive scenes or thematic installations. The consistent scale and orientation across all models ensure easy layout and presentation.
This skull collection is ideal for users who need print-ready, reliable, and visually striking anatomical models. Whether used for study, display, or creative projects, the set delivers professional quality, durability, and flexibility.
Key Features:

  - Set of 4 unique human skull models;

  - Different crack patterns and structural damage on each skull;

  - Anatomically accurate proportions;

  - Fully 3D print-ready (watertight & manifold);

  - Suitable for FDM and resin printers;

  - Clean, texture-free surfaces for easy painting;

  - Scalable without loss of structural integrity;

Available Formats:

  - OBJ

  - STL

  - FBX

  - BLEND

  - MTL

Rendering:Rendered using Cycles
Software Compatibility:Blender version 4.0 (native .blend files)
